# Zurgo's Vanguard: its power is the number of creatures you control (CR 604.3): itself and an Ornithopter make 2, Bot2's
# Ornithopter on T2 does not count; attacking with mobilize 1 (CR 702.181a) its Warrior token makes 3, so Bot2 takes 3 + 1;
# after the Warrior is sacrificed at the end step it is 2/3 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Zurgo's Vanguard
Ornithopter
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Zurgo's Vanguard.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Zurgo's Vanguard.Power = 1
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Zurgo's Vanguard.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Zurgo's Vanguard.Toughness = 3
